      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot rewrite the statement to exclude names and emails from the definition of \"sensitive information\" if your logs confirm those specific records were exported, as this would constitute a deliberate misrepresentation of a known security failure. Even though you distinguish \"data fields,\" once names and emails are proven to have been exfiltrated, claiming such data was uncompromised is factually false and exposes the bank to immediate regulatory actions and civil litigation under data protection laws. You must advise leadership to disclose the specific nature of the breach (including contact details) rather than attempting a semantic workaround that undermines trust when the evidence of the leak is public.",
